# Backend

- Routes live in `backend/app/api/v1/endpoints/`. Enforce RBAC in the endpoint.
- Auth: `get_current_user` in `deps.py`. Cookie `sf_sess`, Bearer, or `x-access-token`.
- Do not add `from __future__ import annotations` in `auth.py` (slowapi / FastAPI body bug).
- Task create/assign calls `send_task_brief_emails`. Catch mail errors; do not fail the request.
- `EMAIL_TEST_RECIPIENT` redirects all outbound mail when set.
- Schema change = new Alembic file under `backend/alembic/versions/`. Do not rewrite applied migrations.
- Seed in `app/scripts/seed.py` must stay idempotent (match by id then email).
- Clock-in gate: `_WORK_FIELDS` (status, checklist, sub_tasks, description). Drive `external_links` is not a work field.
- Manager must not write `billable_amount`.
